  "idea": "Client revision tracker that enforces scope boundaries automatically",
  "text": "Stop letting demanding clients turn a two-week sprint into a six-month revision nightmare. You agree on two revision cycles, but clients keep submitting staggered feedback via WhatsApp, email, and Loom. Without a single locked review deadline, your delivery schedule drifts and client retention drops as frustration mounts. Implement an automated revision gate in Notion that locks asset submissions once contractual deadlines pass. You deliver on schedule and protect agency profits.",
